A scanned copy of no-dues certificate from the Mining Engineer or Assistant Mining Engineer concerned where the
bidder holds or had held mineral concession or royalty collection contract or excess royalty collection contract;
Provided that affidavit and no-dues certificate in case of firm, company or association of persons have to be submitted
by all the partners, directors or persons, as the case may be.
(VI)
